  "notes": [
    "-IR verb with e→i stem change. The stem vowel e changes to i in: all present tense forms except nosotros (sigo, sigues, sigue, siguen), and 3rd person preterite (siguió, siguieron).",
    "Additional spelling change: gu→g before o in yo presente (*sigo*, not *siguio*) to preserve the /g/ sound.",
    "Regular past participle: *seguido*",
    "Used with infinitive to mean \"to keep doing\": *sigo estudiando* (I keep studying).",
    "*Sigue todo recto y gira a la derecha.* (Continue straight ahead and turn right.)",
    "*¿Me sigues en Instagram?* (Do you follow me on Instagram?)",
    "Related: *la siguiente* (the following), *en seguida* (immediately), *según* (according to)"
  ],
  "sourceFile": "Verbs/s/Seguir.md"
